OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of one count
OL,4,Aof rape and three counts of sexual
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,9,Fsexual assault
OL,11,FThe judge tells him "obviously a
OL,12,Fcustodial sentence of some length will
OL,13,Fresult"
OL,15,FThe comedian and actor, 51, has been
OL,16,Fremanded in custody and will be
OL,17,Fsentenced on Monday
OL,19,FBrand faced seven counts: three of
OL,20,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,21,Fof attempted indecent assault
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
