OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of one count
OL,4,Aof rape and three counts of sexual
OL,5,Aassault
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe charges dated from 1999 to 2009 and
OL,8,Fconcerned six women. They are all
OL,9,Fentitled to lifelong anonymity
OL,11,FIt can now be reported that Brand is
OL,12,Fbeing investigated over further rape
OL,13,Fallegations made by two women
